<%
  /* What the House says once the gates have shut.

     Rendered only when the faire is behind us, and only three things: the hand
     that took the weekend, where the pictures are, and thank you. The rest of
     the site goes quiet on its own — the bunks stop being offered, the
     bring-list stops asking — and this is what stands in front of it.

     It reads off the same high hand the roster's ribbon does, so the House
     never names two different winners. */
%>
<% if(over){ %>
<section class="section after"><div class="container">
  <div class="after__box">
    <p class="after__eyebrow">&#10022; The 31st Age of Chivalry &#10022;</p>
    <h2>That was the weekend</h2>
    <p class="after__lede">Thank you to everyone who camped, cooked, dealt a hand or simply
      turned up. The House kept its corner of the faire because you were in it.</p>

    <% if(finest && finest.rank){ %>
      <div class="after__hand">
        <p class="after__k">The finest hand of the run</p>
        <p class="after__who"><b><%= finest.names.join(' & ') %></b>
          <span><%= finest.rank %></span></p>
      </div>
    <% } %>

    <p class="after__acts">
      <a class="btn btn--gold" href="/gallery">See the pictures</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/board/roll">The Roll of Hands</a>
    </p>
    <p class="after__note">Camp, bunks and the bring-list are closed until next year. Everything
      written there is kept &mdash; it is the start of next year&rsquo;s planning.</p>
  </div>
</div></section>
<% } %>
